[I] Repository management tool built on top of git

[T] repo is a tool built on top of Git that helps manage many Git
[T] repositories, does uploads to the Gerrit code review system and
[T] automates parts of the development workflow. It is used for Android and
[T] other projects consisting of many repositories.

[U] https://gerrit.googlesource.com/git-repo

[A] Repo Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 2.74.1
[L] APL

